{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The end of the XIX century. The construction of the longest railway in the world, the Trans-Siberian Railway, is in full swing. A series of mysterious and brutal murders are taking place at one construction site. From the capital, they are sending us, an official on special assignments, Savin Ilya, to investigate. Journalist Vasilisa Olegovna and police chief Artemy Borisovich Rakhnov are going with us.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007460/extras/siberian_way_intro.gif?t=1741115340\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The events in the demo throw us into the thick of things - into the village where the first victims were found.\u00a0 Not only the success of the investigation depends on each choice, but also the lives of the characters. There are two scenarios in the demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007460/extras/about_game.png?t=1741115340\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  INTERACTIVE INVENTORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All the evidence, letters, tips and clues that we find during the investigation are stored there. Everything that can be useful for the task. In addition, we have a revolver revolver, which can be used in case of danger.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007460/extras/sibway_inv_600x200.gif?t=1741115340\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  THE INVESTIGATOR'S DIARY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We keep our thoughts in a diary. In the same place, we record all the important facts for the investigation, take notes on suspects and others.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007460/extras/sibway_dnev_600x200.gif?t=1741115340\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE SCALE OF INFLUENCE ON SATELLITES </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It will appear in the release version of the game and will open additional options in the dialogues.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007460/extras/\u0416\u0438\u0442\u0430\u0445\u0430-\u0432\u043b\u0438\u044f\u043d\u0438\u0435.gif?t=1741115340\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHARACTER SCALE OF THE HERO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each decision made determines the hero on the scale of &quot;Prudent&quot; or &quot;Rebel&quot; and affects the further development of events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3007460?t=1741115340","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007460/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741115340","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007460/e2395b5c277700884455ff47c994a27fc23ff8ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741115340","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007460/e2395b5c277700884455ff47c994a27fc23ff8ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741115340","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"There is unrealistic violence in the form of corpses"},"demos":[{"appid":3011170,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The end of the XIX century. The construction of the longest railway in the world, the Trans-Siberian Railway, is in full swing. A series of mysterious and brutal murders are taking place at one construction site. From the capital, they are sending us, an official on special assignments, Savin Ilya, to investigate. Journalist Vasilisa Olegovna and police chief Artemy Borisovich Rakhnov are going with us.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007460/extras/siberian_way_intro.gif?t=1741115340\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The events in the demo throw us into the thick of things - into the village where the first victims were found.\u00a0 Not only the success of the investigation depends on each choice, but also the lives of the characters. There are two scenarios in the demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007460/extras/about_game.png?t=1741115340\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  INTERACTIVE INVENTORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All the evidence, letters, tips and clues that we find during the investigation are stored there. Everything that can be useful for the task. In addition, we have a revolver revolver, which can be used in case of danger.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007460/extras/sibway_inv_600x200.gif?t=1741115340\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  THE INVESTIGATOR'S DIARY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We keep our thoughts in a diary. In the same place, we record all the important facts for the investigation, take notes on suspects and others.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007460/extras/sibway_dnev_600x200.gif?t=1741115340\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE SCALE OF INFLUENCE ON SATELLITES </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It will appear in the release version of the game and will open additional options in the dialogues.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007460/extras/\u0416\u0438\u0442\u0430\u0445\u0430-\u0432\u043b\u0438\u044f\u043d\u0438\u0435.gif?t=1741115340\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHARACTER SCALE OF THE HERO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each decision made determines the hero on the scale of &quot;Prudent&quot; or &quot;Rebel&quot; and affects the further development of events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["RootGame"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3007460/header.jpg?t=1741115340","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257096843,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096843/movie480.mp4?t=1739296531","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096843/movie_max.mp4?t=1739296531"},"name":"Siberian Way - Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257096843/3486d54a26bd393fe97ece50483d78ff89dd00bb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739296531","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096843/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1739296531","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096843/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1739296531"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257096329,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096329/movie480.mp4?t=1739299491","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096329/movie_max.mp4?t=1739299491"},"name":"Siberian Way Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257096329/3486d54a26bd393fe97ece50483d78ff89dd00bb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739299491","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096329/movie480_vp9.we